the lattice they preserve), a base `e₂, e₃, e₀` with orbits of sizes `240, 72, 9`, transversals
with their Schreier-tree derivations, generators of the successive stabilizers with their
derivations, and the witnesses `s t = t' u` of the Schreier check.
HC no distance; AV milestone no distance.
-/

